Found it. The test passes with `--runInBand` and fails in parallel, so the dark-variant test depends on a `matchMedia` mock that another file installs.

The fix is to install the mock in the test that needs it:

```ts
beforeEach(() => {
  window.matchMedia = vi.fn().mockImplementation((query: string) => ({
    matches: query === "(prefers-color-scheme: dark)",
    addEventListener: vi.fn(),
    removeEventListener: vi.fn(),
  }));
});
```

- [x] Reproduce locally in parallel mode
- [x] Isolate the shared `matchMedia` mock
- [ ] Move the mock into `Button.test.tsx`
- [ ] Re-run CI three times to confirm
